{{!
    @template format_aicourse/activity_card

    A single card in the activity grid. Two shapes share the same wrapper: a normal activity, which
    shows the module icon and a completion status badge, and a mod_subsection card, which shows an
    inline list glyph and navigates to the delegated child section.

    Completion status is never conveyed by colour alone: the link's accessible name repeats the
    status in words, and the badge shows it as visible text. The module icon and the badge tick are
    decorative and carry aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" (the <img> also has an empty alt).

    Classes required for JS:
    * aicourse-activity-card

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-cmid - read by amd/src/courseformat.js.
    * data-for="cmitem" and data-id - the attributes core_courseformat's reactive state manager
      binds to so activity move/visibility mutations can update the card.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * issubsection bool True when this card links to a delegated mod_subsection section.
    * cmid int Course module ID.
    * url string Unescaped target URL.
    * status string Completion status slug: completed, in_progress or not_started.
    * haslabel bool True when the link should carry an aria-label.
    * cardlabel string Accessible name of the link, combining activity name and status.
    * iconurl string Unescaped module icon URL; unused for a subsection card.
    * name string PRE-ESCAPED activity or section name (already through format_string()); rendered
      with a triple mustache so the entities format_string() produced are not escaped twice.
    * typename string Localised module type label.
    * hastime bool Whether an estimated duration is known and non-zero.
    * estimatedtime string Formatted duration, for example "10 min"; shown to sighted users.
    * timelabel string The same duration phrased for a screen reader, for example
    *     "Estimated time: 10 min", so the pill is not announced as a bare number.
    * iscompleted bool True when the tick should be drawn in the status badge.
    * statuslabel string Localised completion status; unused for a subsection card.
    * badgeclass string CSS class of the status badge; unused for a subsection card.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "issubsection": false,
        "cmid": 12,
        "url": "https://example.org/mod/page/view.php?id=12",
        "status": "completed",
        "haslabel": true,
        "cardlabel": "What is machine learning? (Completed)",
        "iconurl": "https://example.org/theme/image.php/boost/page/1/monologo",
        "name": "What is machine learning?",
        "typename": "Page",
        "hastime": true,
        "estimatedtime": "10 min",
        "timelabel": "Estimated time: 10 min",
        "iscompleted": true,
        "statuslabel": "Completed",
        "badgeclass": "aicourse-status-badge-completed"
    }
}}
<a href="{{url}}" class="aicourse-activity-card aicourse-activity-status-{{status}}" data-cmid="{{cmid}}"{{#haslabel}} aria-label="{{cardlabel}}"{{/haslabel}} data-for="cmitem" data-id="{{cmid}}">
<div class="aicourse-activity-card-icon">{{#issubsection}}<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="7" height="7" x="3" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="3" y="14" rx="1"/><path d="M14 4h7"/><path d="M14 9h7"/><path d="M14 15h7"/><path d="M14 20h7"/></svg>{{/issubsection}}{{^issubsection}}<img src="{{iconurl}}" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />{{/issubsection}}</div>
<div class="aicourse-activity-card-body">
<h3 class="aicourse-activity-card-name">{{{name}}}</h3>
<div class="aicourse-activity-card-footer">
<span class="aicourse-activity-card-type">{{typename}}</span>
{{#hastime}}
<span class="aicourse-activity-card-time" title="{{timelabel}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg><span class="accesshide">{{timelabel}}</span><span aria-hidden="true">{{estimatedtime}}</span></span>
{{/hastime}}
{{^issubsection}}
<span class="aicourse-status-badge {{badgeclass}}">{{#iscompleted}}<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>{{/iscompleted}}{{statuslabel}}</span>
{{/issubsection}}
</div>
</div>
</a>
